( By Sri. D.Vijayakumar, Advocate for R-2;
 Notice to R-1 dispensed with vide order dated 09.03.2023)
 This Miscellaneous First Appeal is filed under Section 173(1) of M.V.Act praying to modify and enhance the award amount passed in MVC No.203/2019 on the file of the Court of II Addl. District and Sessions Court and Addl. M.A.C.T at Hassan, vide judgment and award dated 28.01.2020 and to allow this appeal with costs throughout and to grant such other and further reliefs as this Court deems fit to grant in the circumstances of the case, to meet the ends of justice.
